Usage of grade-edition3:
  -ch int
    	Edition 3 chapter to grade (1, 4, 5, 6, 7 or 8) (default 1)
  -consumer string
    	Chapter 4/5/6/7/8 external consumer module directory
  -consumer-case string
    	Chapter 4/5/6/7/8 JSON case file (default: shout example)
  -core string
    	Chapter 4/5/6/7/8 core source module directory
  -gui string
    	Chapter 7/8 separate GUI module directory
  -gui-model string
    	Chapter 7/8 declared GUI model (required)
  -json
    	emit the report as JSON
  -media-models string
    	Chapter 5/6/7/8 media-model mapping JSON
  -stream-exercise string
    	Chapter 6/7/8 stream-shape module directory
  -stream-model string
    	Chapter 6/7/8 declared known streaming model (required)
  -workflow string
    	Chapter 5/6/7/8 workflow module directory
